cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this software supports your research, please cite the release you used."
type: software
title: "Acquire Research Papers"
abstract: >-
  An agent skill and deterministic CLI that acquires identity-verified pairs of an
  official publisher PDF and the publisher's raw BibTeX export, builds auditable
  venue/year/topic corpora with coverage evidence, prepares bounded literature research
  with claim-level evidence, and maintains local PDF/BibTeX libraries through
  hash-bound plans with backups.
authors:
